      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, general audience of internet users who are familiar with internet meme tropes, particularly those involving anthropomorphized animals expressing human emotions. The humor is relatable and non-specific, targeting anyone who has experienced indifference or laziness toward making coffee, a common social ritual.",
